  "releaseNotes": "- [ThunderPropagator#27] [Major] ContinueWith on receive loop task swallows faults silently   ---   AbstractConnectionHandler.cs — Receive loop (most critical):   - ReportException: LogError → LogCritical (criteria: log at Critical level)   - RunReceiveLoopAsync catch block: break → throw so the task actually faults instead of completing silently   - InitReceiving: added ContinueWith that calls OnDisconnect(ConnectionInfo) when faulted, triggering full container cleanup + task disposal",
